{"id":"tod","lemma":"Tod","pos":"noun","rank":314,"glosses":["death"],"ipa":"/toːt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/De-Tod.ogg/De-Tod.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Todes","plural":"Tode"},"formAudio":{"Todes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Todes.wav","Tode":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2a/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Tode.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin dem Tod entkommen.","en":"I escaped death.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/32475","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to escape"}]},{"text":"Er wurde zum Tode verurteilt.","en":"He was condemned to death.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760674","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"to convict","l":"verurteilen"}]},{"text":"Es könnte zum Tod führen.","en":"It could be fatal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392886","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"to lead"}]},{"text":"Was, glaubst du, passiert nach dem Tod?","en":"What do you believe happens after death?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"},{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Du hast mich zu Tode erschreckt.","en":"You scared me to death.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to / too"},null,{"g":"to frighten","l":"erschrecken"}]}]}